(OUT/'PROVENANCE.md').write_text('# Asset provenance\n\nBook/waveform logo, adaptive icon, monochrome and editable cover/background templates: original project vector geometry, generated by scripts/create_assets.py. Master raster is a deterministic rendering of this identity.\n\nhero-book.png and design-concept.png: generated with the built-in OpenAI image tool for this project on 2026-11-02; no reference photographs or competitor artwork supplied. Production illustration is hero-book.png; design-concept.png is a design reference, never an application screenshot.\n\nAdditional unique onboarding, timeline, recorder, upgrade and promotional art remain to be produced/reviewed. Current app reuses the original book illustration and Material icons. Dependency icons retain their upstream Apache licence.\n',encoding='utf-8')
